a, Buddhism, and her cancer surgery. The book also contains a single italicized line running along the bottom of each page that is a kind of story or poem of its own. The title of the book comes from a letter written by Georgia O'Keeffe, in which she signed off \"from the faraway nearby\" by moving from New York to New Mexico. It is also the title of a painting by Georgia O'Keeffe.","matchedBy":"infobox_book:high","confidence":"high","attribution":{"label":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Faraway_Nearby","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"},"infobox":{"author":"Rebecca Solnit","publicationDate":"June 2013 (Viking Books)","publicationPlace":"United States","pages":"272","isbn":"9780143125495","language":"English","subject":"Autobiography, memoir","genre":"Nonfiction"}},"sources":[{"id":"source-award-record-carnegie-nonfiction-ala-carnegie-medals-2014-annual-page","label":"ALA Carnegie Medals 2014 annual page","url":"https://www.ala.org/carnegie-medals/2014-winners","accessedAt":"2026-07-30T21:33:17.917Z","confidence":"official","field":"award","note":"Official awards URL: https://www.ala.org/rusa/awards/carnegie-medals"},{"id":"source-award-record-nbcc-memoir-and-autobiography-wikipedia-national-book-critics-circle-award-for-memoir-and-autobi","label":"Wikipedia: National Book Critics Circle Award for Memoir and Autobiography","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Book_Critics_Circle_Award_for_Memoir_and_Autobiography","accessedAt":"2026-07-30T21:33:17.917Z","confidence":"secondary","field":"award","note":"Official awards URL: https://www.bookcritics.org/awards/"},{"id":"source-award-record-pen-diamonstein-essay-wikipedia-pen-diamonstein-spielvogel-award-for-the-art-of-the-essay","label":"Wikipedia: PEN/Diamonstein-Spielvogel Award for the Art of the Essay","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PEN/Diamonstein-Spielvogel_Award_for_the_Art_of_the_Essay","accessedAt":"2026-07-30T21:33:17.917Z","